                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For decades, the Left has pushed a destructive agenda compromising the safety of American children, and radical medical associations have been part of that effort since the beginning.\n\nEven after the Supreme Court\u2019s recent rebuke, there was no pause in the ongoing betrayal of American children by our once-trusted medical associations. No longer should dangerous gender ideology be pushed on impressionable youth along with access to irreversible drugs and destructive surgeries in the name of \u201cprogress.\u201d We must stand up for our children.\n\nThe Supreme Court took a strong first step to stop this madness and Congress should affirm their decision by passing laws further strengthening the Court\u2019s position.\n\nhttps://t.co/QxAZRhZtme",
