                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill will expand access to childcare for hardworking American families and strengthen paid family & medical leave.\n\nIt will quadruple the maximum employer-provided childcare credit and deliver new relief for small businesses that provide childcare.\n\nThis is critical to supporting American families & working parents.",
