                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was my pleasure to tour the @Sofidelsharing plant in Circleville with Charity, Health & Safety Manager Randy Kuhner, & Facility Manager Brian Graves. The Circleville site is the largest plant worldwide, also known as a mega site. The 283-acre facility is home to over 580 Ohioans & is a third-generation family business.\u00a0\n\nSOFIDEL is the 5th largest producer of paper in the world, producing a whopping 140,000 tons of toilet paper per year. The huge roll of toilet paper behind Charity & me stretches 40 miles in length! I\u2019m honored to advocate for the needs of businesses like theirs in Congress that keep our local communities booming.",
