                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The team at @CincinnatiVamc is committed to providing our Nation\u2019s Heroes with the high quality healthcare and support they deserve, employing more than 2,600 Ohioans and serving over 47,000 veterans.\u00a0\n\nI met with Acting Medical Center Director Jim Hall and Acting Associate Director Benjamin Billon to hear about the services they provide to veterans in the Cincinnati area and see their facilities firsthand.\n\nThey shared how the center will be transitioning to the Federal Electronic Health Record system in the summer of 2026, their needs for infrastructure improvements, and their plan to have a new Community Based Outpatient Clinic in Union Township completed in the fall of 2026. I am a staunch supporter of our Nation\u2019s veterans and am honored to continue advocating for their needs and for the needs of our local VA medical centers in Congress.",
                "text_lang": "en",
