                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday I talked with @OhioEggFarmers & @CooperFarms_ about how avian influenza is impacting the poultry industry & what challenges they\u2019re navigating with animal health.\n\nCooper Farms is a family-owned business in Northwest Ohio that raises turkeys, egg layers, & hogs. The doubled agriculture trade funding in the Working Families Tax Cut will help give businesses like theirs a helping hand.\n\nEven though many agriculture wins were passed in this bill, I\u2019m continuing to push for a Farm Bill 2.0 that further supports the needs of Ohio farmers, ranchers, & producers.",
