                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Alliance for Pharmacy Compounding represents over 600 member pharmacies, ensuring the safety and accessibility of prescription medication in our communities.\n\nThis week, I talked with them about the importance of solving prescription drug shortages and ensuring patients have access to the medicines they need.",
