                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to Economic Development Director Chandler Grooms for assembling a fantastic group of business entrepreneurs, educators, representatives from @Atomic_CU, and the new Director of @AdenaHealth Medical Center, Andrew Bower, to have a robust discussion on business in southern Ohio.\n\nIt\u2019s inspiring to hear about the projects already underway in the Village of Waverly that are improving lives across the entire village and Pike County. I look forward to working with these leaders and Waverly Mayor Rick Henderson to bolster opportunities in the area and help our local business community be successful.",
