                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Democrats want to take away health care for rural Americans.\n\nTheir version of a Continuing Resolution would STRIP the $50 billion in the Rural Health Transformation Program, the single largest investment in rural health through President Trump\u2019s Working Families Tax Cuts. They are literally shutting down the government because they want to take money away from rural health care providers to give it to illegal aliens.\n\nIt\u2019s clear who has rural Americans\u2019 backs when it comes to health care.",
