                "text": "Republicans: \u201cLet's avoid a shutdown and extend funding for 7 weeks so we have more time to agree to year-long appropriations.\u201d\n\nDemocrats: \u201cWe will shut the government down unless we get $1.5 TRILLION in new spending, repeal fraud-reduction measures, . . . and fund health care costs for illegal aliens.\u201d\n\nDemocrats need to stop putting on a show for their far-left base and get serious about keeping the government funded for the American people.",
