                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let's call it like it is: Democrats are shutting the government down because they are mad that Republicans got rid of $200 BILLION worth of benefits noncitizens were getting.\n\nThis is what they are upset about when they say \u201chealth care cuts!\u201d",
