                "text": "The Rural Health Transformation Program will address the health care workforce shortage in rural areas like southern Ohio and ensure sustainable access to care. \n\nWhile Democrats are demanding its repeal in exchange for reopening the government, I\u2019m staunchly advocating for rural providers and patients. \n\nRead my Op Ed:\n\nhttps://t.co/zqweasPr8I",
