                "text": "Yesterday I was honored to join local leaders at a groundbreaking ceremony for the Mt. Orab Family Medicine Clinic at @southernstatecc.\n\nIt\u2019s great to see health centers opening to serve southern Ohioans. I\u2019ll continue advocating for the needs of patients and providers in our region!",
