                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This afternoon I was pleased to attend a ribbon cutting ceremony and grand opening of @befosterparents\u2019s new Behavioral Health Urgent Care in Mt. Orab, in Brown County.\n\nThis facility will provide same-day access to mental health or substance use needs for children and adults in Brown, Clermont, Clinton, Highland and Adams Counties.\n\nIt was great to have State Representative Adam Bird and Brown County Commissioners join as well. We\u2019re grateful for the excellent care Child Focus will continue to provide in our region!",
