                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For too long, rural Buckeye communities have faced unique health challenges in terms of outcomes and access. It\u2019s time to level the playing field.\n\nPresident Trump\u2019s Rural Health Transformation Program will dramatically improve health outcomes for thousands of Ohioans, and I\u2019m grateful for this Administration\u2019s leadership in this area.\n\nI will continue advocating on behalf of my constituents and applaud this program as a historic step in the right direction!",
